to twenty years ago.</i>

01:43.630 --> 01:47.780
<i>So Himekawa-san was conceived 
when he was... eleven?</i>

01:50.830 --> 01:52.720
<i>Oh my god.</i>

01:54.260 --> 01:59.850
<i>Showbiz has a checkered history with 
tons of revolting scandals like this one.</i>

02:00.450 --> 02:05.060
<i>It's a world of beauty and glamour, 
but it also has a dark, ugly side.</i>

02:06.550 --> 02:11.150
<i>I guess this is why they say 
to let the sleeping dead lie.</i>

02:11.890 --> 02:15.890
<i>Even if Kamiki is the mastermind 
and is forced to confess,</i>

02:15.890 --> 02:19.780
<i>he would've been a minor at the time, 
so he wouldn't get jail time.</i>

02:20.600 --> 02:25.970
<i>Should Aqua-kun find him, he'll have 
no way to legally bring him to justice.</i>

02:26.290 --> 02:31.920
<i>Meaning the only way for him to get 
revenge will be with his own two hands.</i>

02:32.680 --> 02:36.390
<i>I can't let Aqua-kun and Kamiki 
make contact, no matter what.</i>

02:36.860 --> 02:38.920
<i>I'll have to deal with this myself.</i>

