03:01.290 --> 03:05.500
<b>Likely an abuser</b>

03:01.290 --> 03:05.500
<b>Aqua Hoshino

Been in showbiz since childhood

Thinks the target of his revenge is dead

Must not be allowed to come in contact</b>

03:12.520 --> 03:14.960
Hello, Aqua-kun?

03:15.450 --> 03:17.220
<i>You sound sleepy.</i>

03:18.470 --> 03:22.440
<i>I've had to walk around 
a lot lately, so I'm exhausted.</i>

03:22.850 --> 03:26.110
I thought you were on break 
until your next shoot started.

03:26.110 --> 03:27.350
What are you up to?

03:27.670 --> 03:30.980
Oh, uh... I'm trying to lose weight!

03:30.980 --> 03:32.560
<i>That part's true.</i>

03:32.560 --> 03:35.990
<i>Why? You're plenty slim already.</i>

03:35.990 --> 03:40.620
Okay, but I'm pretty sure 
you'd hate it if I put on weight.

03:41.590 --> 03:43.920
<i>I love you however you are, Akane.</i>

03:50.980 --> 03:54.170
I knew I made the right choice.

03:54.950 --> 03:57.440
I'm glad I'm going out with you.

03:57.970 --> 04:00.520
<i>Right now, I feel like the 
luckiest girl in the world.</i>

04:01.260 --> 04:02.320
<i>Akane.</i>

04:04.100 --> 04:07.640
Meeting you has been nothing 
but a positive for my life.

04:09.440 --> 04:13.820
You know what I'm like, but you 
accepted me and stood by me.

04:15.320 --> 04:17.750
You told me when things weren't okay,

04:18.750 --> 04:21.580
and little by little, you gave me hope.

04:22.630 --> 04:26.820
It's made me reluctant to let go 
of the times I'm spending with you.

04:30.020 --> 04:31.710
What should I do?

04:32.710 --> 04:34.630
<i>You decide for me.</i>

04:34.630 --> 04:38.210
<i>Should I just forget everything 
and try to live my own life?</i>

04:39.880 --> 04:41.070
Or should I...

04:41.590 --> 04:44.310
What should I do, Akane?

04:44.310 --> 04:46.180
That's not right, Aqua-kun.

04:46.460 --> 04:48.870
<i>You need to make your own decisions.</i>

04:49.520 --> 04:54.340
I don't own you, and you don't own me.

04:54.750 --> 04:58.400
This only works if we're two independent 
people choosing to be together.

04:58.870 --> 05:02.090
<i>Any other kind of relationship 
would just be an addiction.</i>

05:03.470 --> 05:04.370
<i>But...</i>

05:04.960 --> 05:09.950
Once you've made your choice, 
I'll help you as much as you want.

05:10.580 --> 05:12.200
I know I've told you this before.

05:12.760 --> 05:14.790
I want to help carry your burdens—

05:15.120 --> 05:17.120
<i>together with you.</i>

05:20.580 --> 05:22.490
Thanks, Akane.

05:23.940 --> 05:27.910
<i>Aqua-kun's still being held prisoner 
by his mother's death.</i>

05:27.910 --> 05:31.340
<i>But I know the day will come 
when he's freed from it,</i>

05:32.090 --> 05:34.190
<i>and I won't let anyone 
get in the way of that.</i>

05:34.620 --> 05:37.600
<i>I'm sure it'll happen soon, Aqua-kun.</i>

05:41.520 --> 05:44.620
What's wrong? 
You've got a face like a wet weekend.

05:44.620 --> 05:48.120
It's my VTuber sister...

05:48.120 --> 05:52.800
People found a video from back 
when she streamed with her real face!

05:52.800 --> 05:54.830
Oh, so her past life was exposed.

05:55.780 --> 05:59.420
Eh, that's more common than you'd think. 
Nothing to worry about.

05:59.420 --> 06:00.550
Well, in that video,

06:00.860 --> 06:06.760
she went off on people she hated and made 
a whole bunch of problematic statements!

06:01.620 --> 06:06.120
<i>She's got that corpo backing, right? 
She's a total ****, then! Lmao!</i>

06:07.150 --> 06:12.140
Naturally, she got mega-canceled 
and has to stop streaming for a while!

06:12.140 --> 06:13.990
Yikes.

06:13.990 --> 06:14.900
Hey, I've got an idea.

06:15.270 --> 06:18.860
If her real face is out there, 
she might as well join B-Komachi.

06:19.150 --> 06:22.050
She's got the looks and the gift of gab.

06:22.050 --> 06:23.640
I think it'll work out.

06:23.640 --> 06:26.150
Oh, uh, urgh...

06:26.150 --> 06:29.270
I mean, it depends on what she wants.

06:29.270 --> 06:30.490
Ask her!

06:35.460 --> 06:39.220
<i>That girl, huh? 
I'm not against it or anything,</i>

06:39.220 --> 06:41.820
<i>but she's a girl 
with a bit of a toxic side...</i>

06:43.080 --> 06:45.380
<i>A similar gimmick to mine.</i>

06:45.910 --> 06:49.640
<i>And I'm already the least 
popular B-Komachi member.</i>

