13:51.200 --> 13:55.010
My wife grew up in the States, 
and she always says,

13:55.010 --> 14:00.280
"The actors' guilds practically 
hold the reins of showbiz overseas."

14:00.280 --> 14:03.820
But because Japanese agencies 
aren't that powerful,

14:03.820 --> 14:06.950
actors here have to shut up and do 
whatever the showrunners say.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.670
Basically blue-collar workers.

14:08.670 --> 14:10.950
That's painfully accurate.

14:10.950 --> 14:13.860
In Hollywood, 
if a production breaks the rules,

14:13.860 --> 14:17.090
the guild hits the studio with a fine.

14:17.590 --> 14:21.540
They ensure actors are so well protected, 
if an audition makes you wait an hour,

14:21.540 --> 14:23.340
you can bill for that time.

14:23.340 --> 14:27.300
Wow, lucky. I wish it were 
like that in Japan, too.

14:27.910 --> 14:31.020
With Japanese movies, the budget doesn't 
trickle down to the actual productions.

14:31.390 --> 14:34.280
The distributors have too much power.

14:34.280 --> 14:39.740
Internal politics, ageism, 
connections, and agency clout have created

14:39.740 --> 14:42.780
an environment where projects only get 
greenlit with proven box-office stars.

14:42.780 --> 14:44.610
It's unsustainable.

14:46.240 --> 14:50.200
Japan cares far too little 
about actual acting ability.

14:50.200 --> 14:55.670
Maybe it'd change with a guild monitoring 
auditions like they do over there.

14:56.140 --> 14:58.420
But as things stand now, 
we won't develop good actors.

14:59.910 --> 15:03.610
You really care about the actors, huh?

15:03.610 --> 15:04.630
Why wouldn't I?

15:05.220 --> 15:09.600
I want to make good films, 
and I can't do that without good actors.

15:10.260 --> 15:13.490
I want to bring 
real change to this industry.

15:15.070 --> 15:18.780
<i>I'm relieved. He doesn't seem to be lying.</i>

15:18.780 --> 15:21.630
<i>He's a pro who cares about the business.</i>

15:21.630 --> 15:22.530
<i>And besides...</i>

15:22.530 --> 15:23.740
I swear!

15:23.740 --> 15:27.860
Models who get into film are so 
demanding when they can't even act!

15:27.860 --> 15:28.870
Say it louder!

15:28.870 --> 15:33.070
One of them made the bus come 
all the way to their front door,

15:29.580 --> 15:31.510
<i>He's the right amount of bitchy.</i>

15:31.510 --> 15:34.450
<i>I feel like I'm in the acting world 
for the first time in ages.</i>

15:33.070 --> 15:36.350
started complaining to their 
makeup artist about their coactors,

15:34.840 --> 15:37.440
<i>I can discuss art and acting</i>

15:36.620 --> 15:40.060
and basically ruined the mood on set.

15:37.440 --> 15:41.290
<i>and listen to drunks moan 
about bad shoots and coworkers.</i>

15:42.540 --> 15:44.920
<i>I really want to come back here.</i>

15:45.750 --> 15:47.010
You see,

15:47.010 --> 15:51.460
I want to bring about an era where 
real actors like you are valued.

15:52.310 --> 15:56.890
I want my next film to make full use 
of the skills of people like that.

15:57.310 --> 15:58.140
<i>There it is.</i>

15:58.690 --> 16:02.520
Huh? Are you saying you'll cast me in it?

16:02.800 --> 16:04.950
Uh, I'm not sure about that yet.

16:04.950 --> 16:09.030
It'd be a shame if we worked together 
and wound up having creative differences.

16:09.580 --> 16:13.510
So I'd like to get to know you 
better before I decide.

16:13.870 --> 16:19.110
I want to know what's inside you—
your soul? Your philosophy?

16:19.110 --> 16:20.320
My philosophy?

16:21.160 --> 16:23.450
Excuse me. It's almost time.

16:23.450 --> 16:24.890
Oh, right. Thank you.

16:25.860 --> 16:30.480
I'd like to take this elsewhere, 
but I can't drag a kid around so late.

16:30.480 --> 16:31.920
No, it's fine.

16:31.920 --> 16:35.680
I can't drink yet, but I <i>am</i> an adult.

16:36.270 --> 16:40.140
<i>All my idol work did was leave me 
feeling powerless and empty inside.</i>

16:40.140 --> 16:42.400
<i>I was never meant to be 
part of that world.</i>

16:42.990 --> 16:47.180
<i>I have to land a big role here 
and use it to get back into acting.</i>

16:47.880 --> 16:49.910
Let's continue this chat!

16:49.910 --> 16:52.070
Hmm, in that case...

16:52.540 --> 16:54.700
My office is right around the corner. 
Wanna come over?

16:55.950 --> 16:58.410
I'm sure people are still working,

16:58.700 --> 17:00.500
so let's get together and chat.

17:04.580 --> 17:06.990
I love your beauty spot. It's so sexy.

