17:09.590 --> 17:18.060
His staff are still there

17:11.420 --> 17:12.500
What? I had no idea.

17:12.050 --> 17:18.060
Wow, that sounds fun

17:12.500 --> 17:16.920
They say you get 'em where your 
beloved kissed you in your past life.

17:14.010 --> 17:18.060
Are you still held up?

17:16.920 --> 17:19.490
What the heck? That's so romantic!

17:17.090 --> 17:18.060
Yeah, probably a bit longer

17:19.490 --> 17:21.810
You wouldn't know, huh? But I...

17:36.360 --> 17:38.050
Is this okay?

17:38.050 --> 17:41.710
Won't the staff be surprised 
if I show up out of nowhere?

17:43.390 --> 17:46.860
Yeah, I bet they'll jump for joy 
that <i>the</i> Kana Arima is here.

17:46.860 --> 17:48.590
Oh, yeah, where's Mako-chan?

17:49.500 --> 17:51.300
I don't think she's coming.

17:52.710 --> 17:54.010
Huh...

17:58.350 --> 18:00.950
Huh? Did everyone leave?

18:05.220 --> 18:09.320
What a lovely studio. 
Mind if I take a look around?

18:09.320 --> 18:10.210
Go for it.

18:10.570 --> 18:12.570
Wow, it's so big.

18:12.870 --> 18:14.910
<i>Yep, should've seen it coming!</i>

18:15.790 --> 18:18.070
<i>There's a bed and everything.</i>

18:18.930 --> 18:20.480
What'll you have?

18:20.480 --> 18:21.830
Cola, please.

18:22.170 --> 18:23.330
<i>Should I contact Miyako-san?</i>

18:24.090 --> 18:27.040
<i>Nah, I'm an entertainer.</i>

18:27.540 --> 18:29.920
<i>I'm used to these sticky situations.</i>

18:29.920 --> 18:33.010
<i>I just need to be a fun drinking buddy.</i>

18:33.460 --> 18:35.720
<i>And if the director gets horny on me...</i>

18:36.740 --> 18:39.940
Sorry, it's that time of month! Teehee!

18:38.810 --> 18:41.850
<b>teehee :P</b>

18:39.940 --> 18:42.250
What? Aw, that's too bad.

18:42.250 --> 18:44.600
<i>I'll use the magic words to get out of it!</i>

18:51.640 --> 18:53.840
You look like someone 
pulled a fast one on ya.

18:54.710 --> 18:59.070
Relax. I'm not some dumb college kid.

18:59.070 --> 19:01.200
I know where to draw the line.

19:01.200 --> 19:05.460
Right, of course! You wouldn't look 
at little ol' me that way!

19:05.460 --> 19:07.580
Oh, I would. Totally.

19:08.420 --> 19:11.550
I only work with people who interest me.

19:11.920 --> 19:15.930
I can't be all-out unless I'm interested. 
Not in love, and not in work.

19:16.590 --> 19:20.050
I want to work with people 
who <i>make</i> me go all-out for them.

19:20.720 --> 19:21.960
That's all.

19:22.400 --> 19:24.740
You're a player, huh?

19:24.740 --> 19:26.020
I don't deny it.

19:26.670 --> 19:31.020
Aren't you married? What would 
your wife say if she knew about this?

19:31.460 --> 19:35.010
Oh, she plays around 
pretty much every night, too.

19:35.010 --> 19:38.240
We've got a "don't ask, 
don't tell" thing going on.

19:38.240 --> 19:43.080
<i>Why do so many creative types 
have zero common sense?!</i>

19:38.780 --> 19:38.870
<b>w</b>

19:38.870 --> 19:38.950
<b>h</b>

19:38.950 --> 19:39.030
<b>y</b>

19:39.030 --> 19:39.120
<b>w</b>

19:39.120 --> 19:39.200
<b>h</b>

19:39.200 --> 19:39.280
<b>y</b>

19:39.280 --> 19:39.370
<b>w</b>

19:39.370 --> 19:39.450
<b>h</b>

19:39.450 --> 19:39.570
<b>y</b>

19:43.480 --> 19:47.660
You're free to slap me 
and leave if you wish.

19:47.660 --> 19:50.960
Think for yourself, 
and do what's best for you.

19:51.570 --> 19:54.420
That said, I'm not going to hurt you.

19:54.420 --> 19:59.970
I'm showing you my respect and interest 
as a fellow human first and a man second.

20:00.580 --> 20:03.290
I swear it won't be some minor bit part.

20:03.290 --> 20:08.480
I'll give you your ultimate role—
one that will define your career.

20:10.380 --> 20:13.900
Kana Arima, you're an actor 
right down to your soul.

20:15.190 --> 20:17.900
You've felt the pressure of the cameras,

20:17.900 --> 20:20.780
the feeling you only get 
when you let a role take over you,

20:20.780 --> 20:25.030
and that sweet release of laying 
it all bare for everyone to see.

20:26.980 --> 20:28.830
Those things are not 
something you can forget.

20:36.630 --> 20:38.610
<i>I can make it back there again?</i>

20:42.950 --> 20:46.900
<i>If it really gets me back there,</i>

20:48.560 --> 20:49.960
<i>I'll do anything...</i>

21:08.410 --> 21:11.790
I'm sorry... I can't do this!

21:12.680 --> 21:14.040
I...

21:14.650 --> 21:17.160
I have somebody I like!

21:25.300 --> 21:28.180
You like a guy enough to cry about it?

21:28.180 --> 21:29.200
Yeah...

21:30.360 --> 21:32.400
What's he like? Tell me about him.

21:38.300 --> 21:39.570
Ugh! That guy!

21:39.900 --> 21:43.910
He always acts like 
I'm not even on his radar!

21:43.910 --> 21:48.120
But then he gets all nice on me, 
so I get the wrong idea!

21:48.120 --> 21:52.580
I keep trying to forget him, 
but I just can't!

21:52.960 --> 21:57.360
How annoying can you be? 
Die, you stupid piece of trash!

21:57.360 --> 21:59.060
Oh, yeah?

21:59.060 --> 22:01.770
That's actually fascinating. 
I'm entertained!

22:01.770 --> 22:03.900
There's nothing entertaining about it.

22:03.900 --> 22:05.640
That's where you're wrong.

22:06.010 --> 22:09.160
You've tried and failed for a year 
to get over this guy who has a girlfriend,

22:09.160 --> 22:11.890
and you're still here screeching over him.

22:11.890 --> 22:15.360
Women like that are oh-so entertaining.

22:24.600 --> 22:26.820
<i>What the hell is wrong with me?</i>

22:27.140 --> 22:31.120
<i>Never again. I'm sticking to getting 
jobs the right way, with my skills.</i>

22:31.120 --> 22:34.060
<i>Time to grab some ramen and go home.</i>

